[Desktop Entry]
Name=OneNoteOnly
GenericName=OneNote Workstation & Sketch Editor
Comment=The Native Linux OneNote Editor & Viewer — Vector Inks, Sketches, Rich Text & Arbitrary Note Canvas
Exec=onenoteonly %F
Icon=onenoteonly
Terminal=false
Type=Application
